OL,3,GNEWSASuccessful M25 noise reduction
OL,4,Atrial welcomed by MP
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn MP has welcomed what she called a
OL,7,Fsuccessful noise reduction scheme on
OL,8,Fthe M25.
OL,10,FRebecca Paul said National Highways had
OL,11,F"significantly" reduced sound on a
OL,12,Fsection of the motorway in Surrey, due
OL,13,Fto its next-generation concrete
OL,14,Fsurfacing trial.
OL,16,FShe added it would expand the project
OL,17,Fto seven more areas between junctions
OL,18,Feight and nine in 2029-30.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
